<title>FRANCE: Two ships loading 18,500 tonnes of flour at Rouen.</title>
<headline>Two ships loading 18,500 tonnes of flour at Rouen.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships are loading a total of 18,500 tonnes of flour at the French port of Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday,</p>
<p>The flour would be exported to West Africa, they said.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
